/T (The Advance Analytik Viz Pro Single - channel transmitter is an advanced instrument designed for comprehensive water quality monitoring. Capable of measuring multiple parameters such as pH, DO, ORP, conductivity, turbidity, SS, and others, this device offers versatility for a wide range of applications. Its plug-and-play sensor integration simplifies setup, while the flexible configuration allows users to adapt the system to their specific monitoring needs. The transmitter's user-friendly interface enables realtime data visualization and seamless integration with data logging systems, ensuring efficient data management.)
